#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:556 8e2f6d4e3d374f768f309f6d88a2ee8e
msgid "Sets the relative pitch/playback rate."
msgstr "设置相对音高和播放速率。   ``1.0``    为原始音高，   ``2.0``    为两倍速，   ``0.5``    为半速。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:558 f78f2773fd334b2383ba571c20df8d3f
msgid "``1.0``: Normal playback speed"
msgstr "``1.0``   ：正常播放速度"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:560 fe5f2ba1976b49f8984dcc36347f47ef
msgid "Values below 1.0: Slower playback (lower pitch)"
msgstr "小于 1.0：播放变慢、音高降低"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:562 90d701daa1184481a31e7c8da07473f8
msgid "Values above 1.0: Faster playback (higher pitch)"
msgstr "大于 1.0：播放变快、音高升高"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:576 ae7d3c1a31d1422689ded9e9b8b35f11
msgid ""
"Returns the current relative pitch/playback rate. A value of 1.0 means normal playback speed, "
"values below 1.0 slow down playback, and values above 1.0 speed it up."
msgstr "返回当前相对音高和播放速率。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:588 49373e1de5ed44fda81582b299540c32
msgid ":ref:`float<class_float>` **get_audibility**\\ (\\ ) |const|"
msgstr ":ref:`float<class_float>` **get_audibility**\\ (\\ ) |const|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:590 832d8e58d9e9464b85117008c6775529
msgid ""
"Calculates and returns the final audibility of the channel based on all volume attenuation "
"factors. This considers volume levels from the channel itself, its parent channel groups, and any"
" applied 3D attenuation. Returns a value between 0.0 (silent) and 1.0 (full volume)."
msgstr "返回综合音量、静音、3D 衰减和父级混音后的最终可听度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:604 a5ddddafc256407a8d4e4d8057a74c3a
msgid "Sets the volume level in decibels (dB)."
msgstr "设置音量，单位为分贝。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:606 4510b03bad5840ee8e435ac777548dc6
msgid "``0.0 dB``: Unity gain (no change)"
msgstr "``0.0 dB``   ：单位增益，保持原音量"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:608 cf91850949b54f438b53123d7f8c63f9
msgid "Negative values: Attenuate (quieter)"
msgstr "负值：衰减，降低音量"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:610 0ce3a5f47a30400b896c865297fe51a2
msgid "Positive values: Amplify (louder)"
msgstr "正值：放大，提高音量"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:612 329cded115774110afc7963da3d966d4
msgid "Typical range is -80 dB to +24 dB."
msgstr "常用范围为 -80 dB 到 +24 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:626 8c52255f64554d74840bc4d2399af640
msgid ""
"Returns the current volume level in decibels (dB). 0 dB represents unity gain (no change), "
"negative values attenuate the signal, and positive values amplify it."
msgstr "返回当前音量，单位为分贝。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:640 0f7afd33e68240219de99c5eb5d82fd7
msgid ""
"Sets whether volume changes should be ramped (interpolated smoothly over time) or applied "
"instantaneously. Ramping prevents clicks and pops when changing volume."
msgstr "设置音量变化是否使用 FMOD 的平滑斜坡。启用后可减少突然变更音量时的爆音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:654 eef2cb31a1064629beba89ad676ce0ab
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if volume changes are ramped smoothly (interpolated over time), or ``false`` if "
"volume changes are applied instantaneously."
msgstr "返回音量变化是否使用平滑斜坡。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:668 4d475819caea4ef8862356bae34bc499
msgid ""
"Sets the mute state of the channel. When muted, the channel produces no audio output but "
"continues processing."
msgstr "设置静音状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:682 5776a23b1a6049eaa2f584989708553d
msgid "Returns ``true`` if the channel is currently muted."
msgstr "返回当前静音状态。"

