#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1302 74c9e5f2a8c74f01b89799e734250f76
msgid ""
"Sets sample-accurate start and stop times relative to the parent ChannelGroup's DSP clock. This "
"allows precise scheduling of when playback should begin and end."
msgstr "设置相对于父 ChannelGroup DSP 时钟的样本精确开始和停止时间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1304 c56a1e8b709b492db78b8da08dab54b9
msgid "``start``: The DSP clock value when playback should start. Use 0 for immediate playback."
msgstr "``start``   ：开始播放时的 DSP 时钟值，0 表示立即播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1306 235dc6bf9f3c4c088e2926cbda196d0e
msgid "``end``: The DSP clock value when playback should stop. Use 0 to play until manually stopped."
msgstr "``end``   ：停止播放时的 DSP 时钟值，0 表示持续播放到手动停止。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1308 dccdfa4ccb7e4c06b6966f072cb22bcc
msgid "``stop_channels``: If ``true``, channels will be stopped when the end time is reached."
msgstr "``stop_channels``   ：为    ``true``    时，到达结束时间即停止通道。"

