#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1342 98e322688f7a40c3b9e0ff32d3113511
msgid ""
"Adds a sample-accurate fade point at the specified DSP clock time. This allows precise volume "
"automation synchronized to the audio clock. The volume will transition to the specified value at "
"the exact clock time specified."
msgstr "在指定 DSP 时钟处添加一个音量淡变点。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1354 7f7a6ee78132415eb434ff3b3b1d019f
msgid ""
"|void| **set_fade_point_ramp**\\ (\\ dspclock\\: :ref:`int<class_int>`, volume\\: "
":ref:`float<class_float>`\\ )"
msgstr ""
"|void| **set_fade_point_ramp**\\ (\\ dspclock\\: :ref:`int<class_int>`, volume\\: "
":ref:`float<class_float>`\\ )"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1356 ec8a46e2ef3944558cd72631b0000466
msgid ""
"Adds a fade point at the specified DSP clock time with volume ramping. Similar to "
":ref:`add_fade_point()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_fade_point>`, but the volume "
"transition will use a ramp curve for smoother changes."
msgstr ""
"添加从当前音量到指定 DSP 时钟音量的淡变斜坡。 （参见   "
":ref:`add_fade_point()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_fade_point>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1368 734d7927e9d048408934c45987361d49
