"|void| **remove_fade_points**\\ (\\ start\\: :ref:`int<class_int>`, end\\: "
":ref:`int<class_int>`\\ )"
msgstr ""
"|void| **remove_fade_points**\\ (\\ start\\: :ref:`int<class_int>`, end\\: "
":ref:`int<class_int>`\\ )"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1370 e024542fa429458c8c4136a25f1d0dd7
msgid ""
"Removes all fade points between the specified DSP clock start and end values. This cancels any "
"volume automation scheduled within that time range."
msgstr "移除两个 DSP 时钟值之间的所有淡变点。"

