#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:23 06e42adb601f4326897271760a87d86b
msgid ""
"FmodChannelControl provides shared playback, volume, spatialization, DSP-chain, and "
"scheduling operations for :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` and "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`. Obtain an initialized channel or group from "
":ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`; a newly instantiated base object has no FMOD handle."
msgstr ""
"FmodChannelControl 为  :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`  和  "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`  提供播放、音量、空间化、DSP 链和调度操作。通过  "
":ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`  获取已绑定句柄的通道或组；直接实例化基类不会创建 FMOD 句柄。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:438 ee76b6e992994d68b141929afe668794
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if this wrapper stores a non-null ChannelControl pointer. It does not "
"validate the native handle or check whether a channel is still playing."
msgstr "封装保存了非空 ChannelControl 指针时返回  ``true`` 。此方法不会验证底层句柄，也不会检查通道是否仍在播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:450 929383cee3be426dabe2da444190249d
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if this wrapper has no ChannelControl pointer. A stopped channel can still "
"have a non-null stored pointer."
msgstr "封装没有 ChannelControl 指针时返回  ``true`` 。已经停止的通道仍可能保存非空指针。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:474 f787ad3e3a82416991a9bc6f95b4e714
msgid ""
"Stops this channel, or all channels in this group and its nested groups. A stopped Channel "
"handle becomes invalid; a ChannelGroup remains available for subsequent playback."
msgstr "停止当前通道，或停止当前组及其嵌套组中的所有通道。停止后的 Channel 句柄失效；ChannelGroup 仍可用于后续播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:510 8ad170cd57554aa296de59f69700a743
msgid ""
"Sets supported playback mode flags, including looping and 2D/3D spatialization. See "
":ref:`FmodMode<enum_FmodSystem_FmodMode>` for the flags; sound creation flags must be "
"supplied when creating the sound."
msgstr ""
"设置支持的播放模式标志，包括循环和 2D/3D 空间化。标志见  :ref:`FmodSystem.FmodMode<enum_FmodSystem_FmodMode>` "
"；声音创建标志应在创建声音时传入。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1258 20dd0d8d668449289aebf68ab2833098
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary containing ``num_points`` (int), ``point_dspclocks`` (PackedInt64Array),"
" and ``point_volumes`` (PackedFloat32Array). Matching array indices describe the clock and "
"linear volume of each fade point. Returns an empty dictionary on failure."
msgstr ""
"返回包含  ``num_points`` （int）、 ``point_dspclocks`` （PackedInt64Array）和  ``point_volumes`` "
"（PackedFloat32Array）的字典。两个数组的相同索引分别给出淡变点的时钟和线性音量；失败时返回空字典。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1270 c2c528c3ef3347a8b45339b25c8857be
msgid ""
"Installs the wrapper callback for FMOD channel events. Notifications are deferred to Godot. "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` emits its specific signals such as "
":ref:`FmodChannel.ended<class_FmodChannel_signal_ended>`; the base implementation emits "
":ref:`callback_received<class_FmodChannelControl_signal_callback_received>`."
msgstr ""
"安装封装的 FMOD 通道事件回调，通知会延迟到 Godot 执行。 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`  发出  "
":ref:`FmodChannel.ended<class_FmodChannel_signal_ended>`  等专用信号；基类实现发出  "
":ref:`callback_received<class_FmodChannelControl_signal_callback_received>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1282 fab88f25ba2745a296b912f90733b9a1
msgid ""
"Removes the FMOD callback installed by "
":ref:`set_callback()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_callback>`, stopping both base and "
"derived channel-event notifications for this handle."
msgstr ""
"移除  :ref:`set_callback()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_callback>`  安装的 FMOD "
"回调，停止该句柄的基类和派生类通道事件通知。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelcontrol.rst:1022 6a99a1b9f1cc4e3c96641e5cd1f9d184
msgid ""
"Channel counts must be between ``1`` and ``32``. ``inchannel_hop`` must be ``0`` or between "
"``inchannels`` and ``32``. The input must include every active element; padding after the "
"last row is optional. Invalid dimensions, strides, and short arrays are rejected before "
"calling FMOD."
msgstr ""
"通道数必须在  ``1``  到  ``32``  之间。\\  ``inchannel_hop``  必须为  ``0`` \\ ，或介于  ``inchannels``  和  "
"``32``  之间。输入必须包含所有有效元素，最后一行末尾可省略填充。无效尺寸、步长和过短数组会在调用 FMOD 前被拒绝。"
